[[15,1,0,"<aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/768.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2000166.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th colspan=\"1\"><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Before removing and refitting\nthe pretensioners, observe all the specified safety regulations\n(see 7065A Warnings and precautions).</p></aside></th></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div></aside>"],[15,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/2429604\">7040L40</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2429644\">7050A20</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2429642\">7050A10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2429597\">7040H50</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2429594\">7040H38</a></p><p>1. Undo the nut.</p><p>2. Move the seat belt relay.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2045273.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[15,1,0,"<p>1. Undo the nut.</p><p>2. Remove the pin and release the seat belt.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2045274.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[15,1,0,"<p>1. Disconnect the electrical connection from the pretensioner.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Driver&#x27;s seat belt pre-tensioner</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2428789\">Q20</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Front passenger seat belt pretensioner</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2428791\">Q21</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Undo the bolt.</p><p>3. Remove the seat belt and pretensioner (3a) releasing the retainer\n(3b) from the housing.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2045275.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[15,1,0,"<p>Place the pretensioner in the\nspecial cabinet, resting it on a free surface.</p>"],[15,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Reposition the pretensioner\nand make sure that retainer engages in the housing in the bodyshell.</p><p>Tighten the bolt to the specified torque.</p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/768.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2000166.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th colspan=\"1\"><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Do not use impact tools for tightening.</p></aside></th></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div></aside><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>FRONT SEAT BELT PRETENSIONER.</p></td><td><p>M7/16&#x27;</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>4.0</p></td></tr></table></div><p>Connect the electrical connection for the\npretensioner.</p><p>Position the seat belt in its seat and\ninsert the pin.</p><p>Tighten the nut.</p><p>Position the seat belt idler and tighten\nthe nut to the recommended torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Nut</p></td><td><p>FRONT SEAT BELT IDLER</p></td><td><p>M7/16&quot;</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>4.0</p></td></tr></table></div><p><a href=\"#/2429594\">7040H38</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2429597\">7040H50</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2429642\">7050A10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2429644\">7050A20</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2429604\">7040L40</a></p><p>Check the operation of the system using\nthe Examiner or another tester.</p>"]]